ame>Biousse</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Rucker</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Vignal</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Crassard</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Katz</surname><given-names>BJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Newman</surname><given-names>NJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Anemia and papilledema</article-title><source>Am J Ophthalmol</source><year>2003</year><volume>135</volume><fpage>437</fpage><lpage>446</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12654358</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0002-9394(02)02062-7</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>